al","8. Finish","Restoring","1. Decrypt","2. Read the manifest and show what is here","...then, as each item reaches a definite state:","3. Files"],"name_hint":"envrelay"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["EnvRelay","Install","What it needs","Other ways to install","The four commands","Once the agent has gathered what to carry into ~/envrelay-staging-20260830/, you run:","asks for the passphrase twice","On the new machine:","asks for the passphrase once; then the agent takes over the restore","The escape hatch","⚠️ Lose the passphrase and the data is gone","What's in a backup","Trust model","Development","Releasing","License"]},{"path":"README.zh-CN.md","headings":["EnvRelay","安装","需要什么","其他安装方式","四条命令","agent 把要带走的东西整理进 ~/envrelay-staging-20260830/ 之后，你亲手跑：","提示输入口令两次","新机器上：","提示输入口令一次，然后让 agent 接管恢复","逃生通道","⚠️ 口令丢了，数据就没了","备份里有什么","信任模型","开发","发版","许可"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".gitattributes",".github/scripts/check-versions.sh",".github/scripts/package-release.sh",".github/workflows/ci.yml",".github/workflows/release.yml",".github/workflows/smoke.yml",".gitignore","Cargo.lock","Cargo.toml","LICENSE-APACHE","LICENSE-MIT","README.md","README.zh-CN.md","docs/decisions/001-agent-first-autopilot.md","docs/decisions/002-software-compatibility-and-native-handoff.md","docs/decisions/003-ai-executable-v01-scope.md","docs/decisions/004-v01-trusted-core-co-location.md","docs/decisions/005-v02-software-credentials-git-desktop-scope.md","docs/decisions/006-review-timing-and-test-infrastructure.md","docs/decisions/007-v01-scope-convergence-skill-cli-core.md","docs/decisions/008-session-scoped-user-approved-root-grants.md","docs/decisions/009-open-source-assurance-and-local-e2e.md","docs/decisions/010-google-drive-primary-e2e-and-session-power.md","docs/decisions/011-dual-google-drive-layouts-and-portable-vault-bundle.md","docs/decisions/012-user-phrase-and-qr-recover